Jagex assets

Zanik's geometry, colors, rig and animations, and those of her bone crossbow
and bone dagger - in source/zanik*.glb and bundle.dat, and in the renders in
notes/poses.png and icon.png - are taken from the Old School RuneScape game
cache and are excluded from the license above.

